  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance - Baja California Wind Power Project, through Government of Mexico</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This $374,000 feasibility study grant for the Baja California Wind Power Purchase Agreement (PPA) Project is helping the State Government of Baja California to design a 100 megawatt (MW) wind power generation project to supply renewable power to state government office buildings and facilities. The Baja California Wind PPA Project supports the Energy and Climate Change Partnership of the Americas, the U.S.-Mexico Bilateral Framework on Clean Energy and Climate Change, and Mexico&apos;s National Infrastructure Program.</narrative>
  </description>
